<title>ITALY: Pirelli H1 1996 net profit 206 bln lire. [CORRECTED 18:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Pirelli H1 1996 net profit 206 bln lire. [CORRECTED 18:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Group consolidated results</p>
<p>    Net profit				 206  vs  115</p>
<p>NOTE - The Italian tyre and cables group Pirelli said that it saw better results in 1996 than in 1995.  </p>
<p>    Turnover			5,368   vs  down 3.5 pct</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin	652   vs  586</p>
<p>    Operating profit		383   vs  308</p>
<p>(Corrects, reversing Operating profit figures)</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
